__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
data/raw/
*.egg-info/
# data/chroma/ is intentionally committed (~63MB) - it's the pre-built
# vector store, so Render's deploy doesn't need to run the ~15min ingest
# on every build. Regenerate locally with `dsg_compliance.cli ingest`
# and recommit if the source content changes.
